# SOPHIX edge. One process terminates TLS (Let's Encrypt, auto) for every app subdomain and
# reverse-proxies to the internal nginx (web). Base domain comes from $SOPHIX_APP_BASE_DOMAIN
# (set in .env by the deploy); each app is slug.<base>. Add an app = add its host line here.
